1
00:00:00,294 --> 00:00:03,094
That's the feeling we want to address
with this treatment.

2
00:00:03,297 --> 00:00:07,127
Yeah. Or you could pitch in, grab a nostril
and help me get this face off.

3
00:00:07,368 --> 00:00:09,238
(Amy:)Come on. You can do this.

4
00:00:09,436 --> 00:00:12,266
(Sheldon:)You don't know what it's like
to feel completely frustrated.

5
00:00:12,439 --> 00:00:17,779
(Sheldon:)To have a desire build up within you
and be denied any opportunity for release.

6
00:00:25,452 --> 00:00:26,882
(Amy:)Yeah, sounds like a drag.

7
00:00:40,467 --> 00:00:43,767
(Penny:)Okay, help me out here.
Why does he love this show so much?

8
00:00:43,971 --> 00:00:46,941
(Bernadette:)Well, there was action, it was funny.

9
00:00:47,141 --> 00:00:50,441
(Bernadette:)I mean, you do get that usually
the monster chases the pretty girl...

10
00:00:50,644 --> 00:00:53,114
(Bernadette:)...but this time the pretty girl
chases the monsters?

11
00:00:55,182 --> 00:00:59,022
(Penny:)Yippee, it's backwards, I get it.

